met=nc('C21-METFORMIN','C21','Clinical evidence: Low. Metformin inhibited myeloma-cell growth and mouse xenograft growth, with AMPK activation, mTOR-pathway changes, autophagy and cell-cycle arrest. The cell experiments did not show apoptosis. These model findings do not establish tumor control or survival benefit in patients.',[MF],'RPMI8226/U266 cells and NOD-SCID myeloma xenografts','Two cell lines and a mouse model are indirect for clinical treatment; no patient response or safe anticancer exposure is established.',['PMC5859411, Abstract: Methods/Results/Conclusions'],'abstract_and_selected_full_text')
