sim=nc('C21-SIMVASTATIN','C21','Clinical evidence: Low. Simvastatin reduced viability in myeloma cell lines. Cell-cycle effects and the type of cell death differed between lines. An in vitro effect does not establish an effective anticancer dose or benefit in people.',[SV],'U266, RPMI8226 and ARH77 cell experiments','Cell-line susceptibility and differing death pathways cannot supply clinical efficacy, safety or dose selection.',['PMID15551657, Abstract: Methods/Results/Conclusions'])
asp=claim('C21-ASPIRIN-PURPOSE','C21','Anticancer benefit: Not established by the aspirin study. Its randomized comparison with enoxaparin concerned clot prevention during lenalidomide-based myeloma treatment. This is human supportive-care evidence, not a test of aspirin as an antimyeloma drug. Different treatment purposes cannot be pooled into one cancer-benefit estimate.',[AS],'Clot-prevention purpose, not tumor response','not_established','The randomized substudy answers a thromboprophylaxis question, not an aspirin antitumor-effect question.',['PMID21835953, Abstract'],'abstract_only',['Prospective open-label randomized thromboprophylaxis substudy.','Direct for supportive care in the included myeloma regimen, not antitumor activity.','No aspirin tumor-response or anticancer-survival effect is supplied by this comparison.','One prevention study is not replication of an antitumor intervention.','Exact original PubMed abstract inspected; old source record retained.'])
channel=claim('C06-CHANNEL','C06','Clinical evidence: Low for symptom benefit. The TRPM3 study examined natural-killer cells from nine people with ME/CFS already taking naltrexone and nine healthy controls. Channel currents resembled those in healthy-control cells. There was no randomized treated-versus-untreated ME/CFS comparison measuring recovery, daily function or post-exertional malaise.',[TR],'Patient-derived NK-cell recordings; clinical translation','Low','Preexisting medication use and a healthy-control cellular comparison cannot isolate a clinical treatment effect.',['PMID34326841 / PMC8313851, Abstract; Methods'],'abstract_and_selected_full_text',['Small observational treated-patient versus healthy-control cellular study, not randomized symptom treatment.','Human participants supplied cells; electrophysiology is indirect for symptom benefit.','Nine patients and nine controls; no comparative clinical efficacy estimate.','Cell recordings and participant counts are not independent clinical trials.','Exact PMID/PMCID/DOI identity and original abstract checked; full review pending.'])
cases=claim('C06-HUMAN-CASES','C06','Clinical evidence: Low. Three published patient-compiled case histories described variable symptom changes during naltrexone use. One reported better pain and sleep without improved function. Self-selection, retrospective reporting, other treatments and illness fluctuation prevent a causal response estimate; these cases do not establish a validated ME/CFS dose.',[newid],'Three uncontrolled CFS case histories; benefit and dosing uncertainty','Low','Retrospective self-selected case descriptions lack a control and cannot estimate who will respond or an optimal regimen.',['PMC6954765, Case presentations; Outcome and follow-up: cases1-3; Discussion'],'selected_full_text',['Patient-compiled retrospective case reports; two patients are coauthors.','Direct reported human experiences, without an isolated treatment effect.','Three selected cases, no comparative response rate or interval.','Different symptom and function trajectories; not controlled replication.','Original PMC HTML identity/hash verified; independent/human review pending.'])
caseharm=claim('C06-CASE-SAFETY','C06','Safety evidence: Low for estimating frequency. Headaches and vivid dreams occurred in the case descriptions. Three reports are too small to characterize uncommon harms, interactions or the safety of a particular low-dose regimen.',[newid],'Reported case tolerability, not population incidence','Low','Anecdotal adverse-event descriptions do not supply a systematic risk denominator.',['PMC6954765, Treatment: cases1-2; Discussion'],'selected_full_text',['Case descriptions rather than systematic adverse-event surveillance.','Direct individual experiences, not population safety.','No incidence denominator or safe-dose threshold.','Different experiences across three self-selected cases.','Private original HTML hash verified; full safety appraisal pending.'])
